                'Polyuria and polydipsia: Less pronounced than T1DM',
                'Fatigue and lethargy',
                'Blurred vision: Osmotic lens changes',
                'Recurrent infections: Candidiasis, UTI, slow-healing wounds',
                'Age >40 years (but increasing in younger adults)',
                'Obesity: 80% are overweight/obese (BMI ≥30)',
                'Acanthosis nigricans: Dark velvety skin patches (neck, axillae) - insulin resistance'
